---
---
<section class="install-section shell reveal" id="install">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="install.eyebrow">获取与安装</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="install.title">几秒钟内，开启指尖极速体验。</h2>
    <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="install.lede">
      推荐使用 Homebrew Cask 一键安装，或下载 DMG / 访问 Mac App Store。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="install-container">
    <div class="install-tabs">
      <button class="inst-tab-btn active" data-tab="brew" data-i18n="install.tab.brew">Homebrew Cask (推荐)</button>
      <button class="inst-tab-btn" data-tab="dmg" data-i18n="install.tab.dmg">官网 DMG 下载</button>
      <button class="inst-tab-btn" data-tab="store" data-i18n="install.tab.store">Mac App Store</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 1: Homebrew -->
    <div class="tab-pane active" id="pane-brew">
      <p class="pane-desc" data-i18n="install.brew.step">只需复制并在 macOS 终端中运行以下命令：</p>
      <div class="terminal-block">
        <div class="terminal-bar">
          <div class="mac-traffic-lights">
            <span class="tl-btn tl-close"></span>
            <span class="tl-btn tl-min"></span>
            <span class="tl-btn tl-max"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="terminal-title">zsh — Terminal</span>
          <button class="terminal-copy-btn" data-copy="brew install --cask LanrenwenStudio/tap/key-launch" data-i18n="install.brew.copy">复制命令</button>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <span class="prompt">$</span>
          <code>brew install --cask LanrenwenStudio/tap/key-launch</code>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="upgrade-note" data-i18n="install.brew.upgrade">后续只需一行命令随时更新：</p>
      <div class="mini-terminal">
        <code>brew upgrade --cask key-launch</code>
        <span class="mini-copy" data-copy="brew upgrade --cask key-launch">📋</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 2: DMG -->
    <div class="tab-pane" id="pane-dmg">
      <div class="dmg-action-box">
        <a href="https://github.com/LanrenwenStudio/key-launch/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="download-large-btn">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
          <span data-i18n="install.dmg.btn">下载 DMG 安装包 (v1.3.19)</span>
        </a>
        <p class="dmg-note" data-i18n="install.dmg.note">支持 Apple 芯片 (M1/M2/M3/M4) 与 Intel 架构 · macOS 13 (Ventura) 及以上</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 3: Store -->
    <div class="tab-pane" id="pane-store">
      <div class="store-action-box">
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/keylaunch/id6742337775" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="store-large-btn">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M15.97 6.37c.61-.75 1.04-1.8 0.92-2.85-.92.04-2.06.62-2.73 1.39-.58.67-1.1 1.74-.96 2.78 1.04.08 2.13-.53 2.77-1.32z"/></svg>
          <span data-i18n="install.store.btn">从 Mac App Store 下载</span>
        </a>
        <p class="dmg-note" data-i18n="install.store.note">(注：App Store 审核周期可能导致版本更新略有延迟)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
